# Audited: the child's label shows the host's hold at the build (its first value, read in the birth tick); a click on the host's button changes the hold in its tick, and the child hears the new text as the next tick's input, the owed tick.

test a_dynamic_answer_pushes_next_tick, @host:
    build
        => expect Ui.Label(text="first")
    click at 0
        => expect Ui.Label(text="first")
    compute
        => expect Ui.Label(text="second")
